      "content": "It sounds like you're going through a profound and painful loss of identity, and that feeling of emptiness is incredibly heavy. Please know that this sense of loss, while overwhelming, is a common experience when big parts of our self-concept shift. You are not just a collection of achievements; your inherent worth is not tied to what you've built. Reconnecting with who you are outside of those external markers is a difficult but possible journey.",
