    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just about small things though. it's the exhaustion of it all. i've spent my whole life running at 100% and now that i've crashed, there's no point in even trying to get back up. it's like i'm just waiting for a version of me that doesn't exist anymore. i just want the noise to stop. i just want to stop feeling like i'm failing at existing every single second of the day.",
